        <h2 class="text-center" style="font-size: 28px; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 30px;">Declaration</h2>
        
        <p>We hereby declare that the project <strong>"Cash-Book: Smart Finance &amp; Digital Ledger"</strong> is our original work completed as part of our academic requirements. The project provides an online platform for personal and small business finance management, featuring tracking of daily transactions, party ledgers, EMI/subscriptions, receipt management, and deep analytics.</p>
        
        <p>Cash-Book is developed using <strong>React, Node.js, and MongoDB</strong>, representing a complete, full-stack, scalable digital ledger solution.</p>
        
        <p>We sincerely thank our <strong>guide</strong> and our <strong>parents and family members</strong> for their continuous support, guidance, and encouragement throughout this project.</p>
        
        <p>We further declare that this work has not been submitted to any other institution for any degree, diploma, or certificate.</p>
        
