    <!-- Page 5: Introduction -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-header">Cash-Book: Smart Finance &amp; Digital Ledger</div>
        
        <div class="title-box">1. Introduction of Project</div>
        
        <ul>
            <li>It aims to simplify personal and small business finance management by offering a fast, convenient, and accessible way to track income, expenses, and debts.</li>
            <li>The platform eliminates the limitations of traditional paper ledgers, such as data loss, manual calculation errors, and restricted physical access.</li>
            <li>It offers essential financial management features including:
                <ul>
                    <li>User registration &amp; secure authentication</li>
                    <li>Daily transaction tracking (Income/Expense) categorized dynamically</li>
                    <li>Party Ledger (Udhaar Book) for tracking debts and credits</li>
                    <li>EMI &amp; Subscription tracking with calendar views</li>
                    <li>Receipts Vault for securely storing bill images</li>
                    <li>Advanced analytics and summary reports</li>
                    <li>Shared cashbooks through user invitations</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>For admins, the system includes:
                <ul>
                    <li>System analytics and user metrics</li>
                    <li>Transaction and cashbook oversight</li>
                    <li>Platform setting configurations</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Cash-Book acts as a digital companion, allowing users to make informed financial decisions through clear insights and organized records.</li>
            <li>The project uses modern web technologies:
                <ul>
                    <li>Frontend: React (Vite)</li>
                    <li>Backend: Node.js (Express)</li>
                    <li>Database: MongoDB (Mongoose)</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>It serves as a real-world implementation of an end-to-end financial SaaS solution.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class="footer-line" style="position: static;"></div>
        <div class="page-number" style="position: static;">4</div>
    </div>

